zipgetter (0.11.0-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Downloaded file names are now percent-decoded (My%20File.zip is saved
    as "My File.zip"); slashes and NUL bytes produced by decoding become _.

 -- Juan Carlos Castro y Castro <jccyc1965@gmail.com>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:48:41 -0300

zipgetter (0.10.0-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Breaking: -e now requires an extensions list; use -e common for the
    common archive extensions, optionally combined with others
    (-e common,iso).
  * -s now falls back to the chromedriver on PATH when Selenium can't find
    a driver, so it works with the python3-selenium package.
  * -s warns when the installed Selenium is older than 4.18.
  * New exit code 5 when -s is given but Selenium is not installed.
  * --version now prints copyright, license and author information.

 -- Juan Carlos Castro y Castro <jccyc1965@gmail.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:04:51 -0300

zipgetter (0.9.1-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging, including a man page.
  * The script is now named zipgetter instead of zipgetter.py.

 -- Juan Carlos Castro y Castro <jccyc1965@gmail.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:01:05 -0300
